The '''Maths Enjoyer''' is an [[NPC]] located inside {{zone|Thaumaturgist}}. They tell players the formula for [[Accessory Power]].

== Formula ==
The formula that they give is <math>\text{Stats Multiplier}=29.97\times\left(\ln\left(0.0019\times\left(\text{Accessory Power}\right)+1\right)\right)^{1.2}</math>.

